HYP-2789/S75 one-far endpoint-period certificate
Binding rows: B=consec_(k-1), k=8..12, all wide w>=15.
Exact identity: Delta_w = S_B(w)/w, with S_B periodic in w.
The period is the lcm of Abel endpoint denominators, not a mod-7 table.

